# Personal Persistent Subagent Team

This is the authoritative roster for LYH's personal Codex subagents. It was derived from a
read-only scan of 23 registered local/remote Git projects plus the active ChatGPT project domains
on 2026-08-26. Project-level `AGENTS.md`, skills, task authority, and live evidence always override
this routing guide.

## Roster

