| `frontend_ui_engineer` | Implement React/TypeScript/Vite, Tauri webviews, Obsidian/Electron interfaces, responsive layouts, accessibility, and visual interaction states. | `gpt-5.6-sol` | `high` | workspace-write |
| `academic_writing_editor` | Work on Chinese theses, papers, LaTeX/Typst/BibTeX, journal revisions, citation workflows, resumes, and evidence-bounded academic prose. | `gpt-5.6-sol` | `max` | workspace-write |
| `industrial_ai_methodologist` | Analyze and implement time-series AI, soft sensors, diffusion/Mamba/MoE, world models, multi-objective decisions, experiments, and leakage-safe evidence. | `gpt-5.6-sol` | `max` | workspace-write |
